  <data name="MappingIntroduction" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Measures the motherboard temperatures for 20 seconds at idle and then for 60 seconds with all CPU cores fully loaded. From the reaction it suggests what each sensor measures. Close other demanding programs first. Reading the motherboard sensors requires administrator rights.</value>
